4465  9ED2              ; svc_fill_p3dos_header: fill 8-byte +3DOS header data via DOS_REF_HEAD.
4466  9ED2              ; Called from svc_extract_to_file while in dospage, before switching back.
4467  9ED2              ; B = file number (must equal 1). Uses viewExtractCnt and viewPluginContext.
4468  9ED2              ; ================================================================
