 852+ B414              ; ================================================================
 853+ B414              ; Extraction services. Both write a byte range into a new file in the
 854+ B414              ; active panel directory; they differ only in where the bytes come from.
 855+ B414              ;
 856+ B414              ; SERVICE_EXTRACT takes them from the loaded data pages, so a plugin can
 857+ B414              ; write back data it has modified in RAM (the editor saves this way).
 858+ B414              ; SERVICE_EXTRACT_SEEK re-reads them from the source file instead, which
 859+ B414              ; is the only way to reach data past the 64KB the viewer keeps in RAM
 860+ B414              ; (TRD disk images are up to 640K).
 861+ B414              ; The shared steps live in view_extract_prepare/open_dest/exit.
 862+ B414              ; ================================================================
 863+ B414
