8648  E501              ; Blocking keyboard input for code running in MMU7.  The resident INKEY
8649  E501              ; cannot be used here: its retry path calls gettime, and gettime changes the
8650  E501              ; $C000-$FFFF mapping through $7FFD.  Require a full release both before and
8651  E501              ; after the key so the H used to open Help is not consumed by the dialog.
8652  E501              ; The press is read with the mouse as well (kmouse/ui.a80).
8653  E501              extra_read_key:
